	(text "TIM1 CH1/CH1N..CH3/CH3N (PE8-PE13),\n6x PWM mode, dead time in the MCU.\nINHx/INLx have internal 100k pull-downs;\nENABLE low forces GHx to SHx and GLx to\nPGND, so the bridge is off in MCU reset."
